+   KLZH2 (codec 32): KLZH's parse and repeat offsets with a second entropy stage (opt-in KOLMO_NATIVE=lz2; codec 29 is
+   unchanged and stays readable):
+     sequence count ns uv | literal count nl uv | if ns > 0: flags u8 (0, or 1: offset nibbles are a stream) |
+     literals (nl) | tokens (ns) | literal-length codes | match-length codes after a repeat offset | match-length
+     codes after a new offset | offset nibbles (only with flag 1) | extra bits (the rest; least significant first;
+     per sequence: literal length, match length, offset).
