+     2 and 3: payload length uv and the payload. Literals: mode 2 a khuf block (khuf.h), mode 3 tANS over bytes; a
+     literal chunk has at most KHUF_BLOCK_MAX bytes. Code streams: mode 2 tANS with its own table, mode 3 tANS with
